<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 17.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw Stock Exchange on Friday saw 19,000 variable-interest five-year bonds maturing on November 6, 1998 trading at 100.9 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was at two million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
